les (system root). |\n| `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib` | Put libraries in `/usr/lib` (not `/usr/lib64`). |\n| `-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=icx` | Use Intel's **C** compiler. |\n| `-DCMAKE_CXX"}